  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Program for the Reactivation of Production in the Province of Neuquen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Crdito para la Reactivacin de la Produccin de la Provincia del Neuqun</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir a la recuperacin de la produccin y apoyar la sostenibilidad del empleo en la Provincia del Neuqun. El objetivo especfico de desarrollo del programa es proveer a empresas Micro, Pequeas y Medianas Empresas (MIPYME) beneficiarias que operan en la Provincia del Neuqun, de financiamiento productivo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to contribute to the recovery of production and support the sustainability of employment in the Province of Neuqun. The specific development objective of the program is to provide beneficiary Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) that operate in the Province of Neuqun with productive financing.</narrative>
  </description>
